1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Everyone says India can't make its own chips.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,200
One startup just proved them wrong.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,800
Netrasemi, in Kerala, raised ₹107 crore, led by Zoho,

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,800
to design edge-AI chips in India, with its own IP.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:20,400
India writes world-class software, but imports almost every chip it runs on.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,300
This money funds the hardest frontier, the silicon itself.

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,500
Self-reliance is the real thesis.
